{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["3d2f29bc-e9c7-4cf6-bdaf-3636167046c5"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["52e19b28-9e17-5fc3-ae69-d32610f44568"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["e2a490c1-d938-584d-8113-94dca98ae526"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A new concept, **CEPHEID**, was created and is active in the Device Extension Module. Its stated definition is a single necessary-set axiom that makes it a subtype of **Device Labeler**. It has no inferred parents yet, so it hasn't been classified. I couldn't resolve the Device Labeler concept itself in the tool, so that parent comes from the stated axiom only."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["42132ce0-6119-49f3-b99c-ae4496a599b4"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["52e19b28-9e17-5fc3-ae69-d32610f44568"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["4477ea86-991a-5f16-ae6a-f24edda3f91a"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A new concept, **CEPHEID**, was created as an active component in the Device Extension Module by the Device Extension Author. Its stated definition is a necessary-set axiom with a single parent, **Device Labeler**. It has one description, the fully qualified name \"CEPHEID\". It has no inferred position yet on this view."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["2cc78587-023c-474f-9bb7-6897aa9c95c2"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["52e19b28-9e17-5fc3-ae69-d32610f44568"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["434531a6-2c63-54e4-8f92-6cbe6ef92b3d"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A new stated definition was added for **CEPHEID**. It is a necessary set with a single parent, **Device Labeler**, so the concept is now modeled as a Device Labeler. The change was authored by Device Extension Author on the Device Extension Module. The view returned no inferred form for CEPHEID, so I could not confirm where it sits after classification."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["bd46281e-4d64-48ae-b362-e6edf3aebfd5"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["52e19b28-9e17-5fc3-ae69-d32610f44568"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["d36b87ea-c9e1-5d2d-a5ca-33c5e8c04bc1"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"I couldn't resolve this component, so I can't say what changed. The UUID 52e19b28-9e17-5fc3-ae69-d32610f44568 returned nothing as a concept or as a semantic under the active view (Latest on Development path, all modules). The commit record shows only that the component was ACTIVE before and after, authored by Device Extension Author on Device Extension Module. The change was probably to a field value or a non-status attribute, but I can't confirm that."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["135713c6-29ae-4db9-98f4-09c3db7609d3"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["9c0c2884-e18c-55d4-9fde-0f3f926f868e"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["a218e3b1-c017-557e-a6d8-d40304ad1503"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"I couldn't work out what changed in this commit. The component ID 9c0c2884-e18c-55d4-9fde-0f3f926f868e isn't visible under the active view, which is the Development path with all modules and both ACTIVE and INACTIVE states. It didn't resolve as a concept or as a semantic, and it has no attached semantics.\n\nThe commit metadata says the component stayed ACTIVE. It was authored by Device Extension Author on the Field defaults module. I can't name the component or say what content changed without more information, such as the parent concept or the pattern it belongs to."}]}]}}
