{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["b0886add-caf4-4a52-826a-e4cb9a12cae3"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["83de670e-84d8-5e34-82c2-18d16cd3ce3d"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["37319e55-f38b-518b-8ff5-2f834e606327"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A Test Performed record was added to **GeneXpert® XPRS-COV2-10**, and the commit updated the comment describing it. The record sets the analyte to SARS-CoV-2 and the targets to the N, E and RdRP genes. It uses Nasopharyngeal swab (specimen) [258500001] as the specimen and Not applicable (qualifier value) [385432009] as the example unit. It also lists four GeneXpert Dx System instruments: GXXVI-16, GXXVI-4, GXXVI-8 and GXIV-2.\n\nI confirmed the two SCTIDs and the device concept in the knowledge base. I did not check the analyte, targets or instruments, so those come from the comment text alone. The tools did not show the previous version of the comment, so I can't say what the edit changed within it."}]}]}}
