{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["f184fb84-264d-4f44-9101-59691552bdc5"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["75653ab0-f98d-5a88-956f-5361995bc9d2"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["52f3e896-6370-5db3-a716-e1a34bbe2231"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A Limit Metrics Pattern semantic on GeneXpert® XPRS-COV2-10 was edited and is still active. It now records a Limit of Detection of 462.0 in Copies per millilitre (SCTID 413913003). The tools don't show the previous version, so I can't say which field changed. GeneXpert® XPRS-COV2-10 is a child of Respiratory Specimen Nucleic Acid Sars-Cov-2 Test."}]}]}}
{"semantic_chronology":{"public_id":{"uuids":["c3e6f222-03b9-4048-a18d-40fdee61fef4"]},"referenced_component_public_id":{"uuids":["a18bccf8-34c5-59e1-af86-fc1a8c5d9f06"]},"pattern_for_semantic_public_id":{"uuids":["3734fb0a-4c14-5831-9a61-4743af609e7a"]},"semantic_versions":[{"stamp_chronology_public_id":{"uuids":["93aa03eb-c767-52b4-9dd9-45345b2d2e59"]},"fields":[{"string_value":"A Limit Metrics record was edited and recommitted, still active, by Device Extension Author on the Device Extension Module. It records a Limit of Detection of 403.0 Copies per millilitre (SCTID 413913003). I could not see the previous value, so I can't say which field changed. The record appears to belong to the test performed for GeneXpert® XPRS-COV2-10 (Xpert® Xpress CoV-2 plus), a child of Respiratory Specimen Nucleic Acid Sars-Cov-2 Test. I could not confirm that link directly, because the record did not show up among that concept's listed semantics."}]}]}}
